<title>USA: Monmouth Regional High Sch Dist, N.J. -Correction.</title>
<headline>Monmouth Regional High Sch Dist, N.J. -Correction.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>McManimon &amp; Scotland, Bond Counsel for the Monmouth Regional High School District, corrects the following:</p>
<p>NOTICE OF CORRECTION</p>
<p>The Board of Education of the</p>
<p>Monmouth Regional High School District</p>
<p>County of Monmouth, New Jersey</p>
<p>$6,995,000 School Bond Sale</p>
<p>The required good faith deposit check for the sale</p>
<p>of the above captioned bonds on Thursday, January 16,</p>
<p>1997 is $139,900, which is the amount listed in the Notice of</p>
<p>$6,995,000 School Bond Sale, and not $17,780</p>
<p>as listed on the bid or proposal form.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
